---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { routeUrl } from '../../i18n';

const lang = 'en' as const;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy · Accanto"
  description="How Accanto handles your data: minimum necessary, no profiling, full export, self-hosting option."
>
  <article class="container-page container-prose">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold mb-6">Your data, your rules</h1>

    <nav aria-label="Page index" class="mb-8">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-2">On this page</p>
      <ul class="text-sm text-accanto-600 space-y-1">
        <li>• <a href="#what-we-collect" class="underline">What we collect</a></li>
        <li>• <a href="#what-we-dont-do" class="underline">What we don't do</a></li>
        <li>• <a href="#self-hosting" class="underline">Self-hosting</a></li>
        <li>• <a href="#your-rights" class="underline">Your rights</a></li>
        <li>• <a href="#security" class="underline">Security</a></li>
        <li>• <a href="#medical-notice" class="underline">Medical notice</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <p>Accanto handles sensitive information about the health of the person you care for.
    That is why we chose a "privacy by design" approach from day one.</p>

    <h2 id="what-we-collect">What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The information you enter (notes, symptoms, documents, contacts).</li>
      <li>The data strictly required for the account to work (email, password hash, essential logs).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="what-we-dont-do">What we don't do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We do not sell your data.</li>
      <li>We do not run advertising profiling.</li>
      <li>We do not embed third-party trackers for commercial purposes.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="self-hosting">Self-hosting</h2>
    <p>Accanto can be installed on your own server. In that case the data stays physically in your environment.
    AI mode is optional and can be connected to a local model (for example via Ollama).</p>

    <h2 id="your-rights">Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can export your data or request deletion at any time from your personal area.
    For specific requests reach us via the <a href={routeUrl('contact', lang)}>contact</a> page.</p>

    <h2 id="security">Security</h2>
    <p>Passwords are stored only as hashes. Sessions are signed and revocable. Connections use HTTPS.
    We work to keep the attack surface small and well watched.</p>

    <h2 id="medical-notice">Medical notice</h2>
    <p>Accanto is not a medical device. The information in the application does not replace qualified medical advice.</p>

    <p class="text-sm text-accanto-500 mt-10">This page is an orientation summary, not a complete privacy notice — that can be requested via the contact page.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
